Z||000016||2xsess||02-18-2001||02:07 PM||||How about Buttery Nipples? mmmm yummy.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Electric Lemonade is a cool mixed drink too.<P>Here's one for you all.<P>Roll me of and do me again<BR>1/4 part light rum<BR>1/4 part dark rum<BR>1/4 part Midori<BR>1/4 part Malibu<BR>splash of Creme de Bananas<BR>Fill with equal parts OJ and Pineapple add a touch of grenadine for color and shake.<BR>In a regular glass of course. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>AOL IM : Only2xsess<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2xsess.gif">        <BR> <A HREF="http://kresgeus.homestead.com/FieroPage.html" TARGET=_blank>Visit My Website</A><P><p>[This message has been edited by 2xsess (edited 02-18-2001).]||||reg||10
