Z||000018||Standard||02-22-2001||11:49 PM||||mmmm... Jaeger... that stuff rules.<P>I used to only drink screwdrivers.. then I found beer... but usually by the end of the night I'm taking shots of whatever I can find sitting around...   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>One thing I have to try is red bull and vodka, one person i talked to said it's like liquid cocaine.. sounds fun  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR><p>[This message has been edited by Standard (edited 02-22-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000019||bHooper||02-23-2001||09:05 AM||||in order of preferance:<P>1) Winford Reserve, on the rocks<BR>2) Gentleman Jack, on the rocks<BR>3) Jack Daniels, on the rocks<BR>4) Black Velvet, on the rocks (did you know it's the same as Crown Royal, same barel's, just not aged as long?)<P>thats the dark stuff, now as for Tequila.. i don't mess around here, only the good stuff:<P>1) el conquistador, straight up from a cold bottle<BR>2) Heradura Arejo, straight up from a cold bottle<BR><P>------------------<BR>hoop<BR>Red '86 GT<BR>KYB's, Eibach's,<BR>Poly Bushings||||reg||1
Z||000020||ferg||02-23-2001||09:10 AM||||my preferences<BR>1) Crown and Water<BR>2) Vodka Collins<P>opps! forgot one <P>3) Baltimore Zoo - damn tasty<P>1 shot vodka<BR>1 shot light rum<BR>1 shot dry gin<BR>1 shot triple sec<BR>1 shot amaretto<BR>1 shot southern comfort<BR>1/2 shot red grenadine<BR>sour mix<P><BR><p>[This message has been edited by ferg (edited 02-23-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000021||KnightRyder31||02-23-2001||10:09 AM||||Favorite mixed...<BR>3 measures of Gordon's Gin<BR>1 measure of vodka<BR>1/2 measure Kina Lillet vermouth<P>Shake it very well until it's ice cold, pour into a deep champange glass. Garnish with a large thin slice of lemon peel. <P>Can you guess what type of drink this is???<P>You know... I also love drinking JD straight, ummmm.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000022||stimpy||02-23-2001||10:13 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by bHooper:<BR><B><BR>thats the dark stuff, now as for Tequila.. i don't mess around here, only the good stuff:<P>1) el conquistador, straight up from a cold bottle<BR>2) Heradura Arejo, straight up from a cold bottle<P><BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Right on hoop, sounds like a party. If you can find it, I recommend Cazadores. Smooth as silk! I've had a hard time finding it outside of California though. Last 2 bottles I had to go to Cozumel for. <P>As for mixed shots, cranberry Kamikazi is mighty fine, and Tanqueray and Tonic is my late night party drink of choice. My wife likes Bellini's. (peach schnapps,brandy, champagne, and ornge juice, frozen)<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000023||2xsess||02-23-2001||10:38 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by KnightRyder31:<BR><B>Favorite mixed...<BR>3 measures of Gordon's Gin<BR>1 measure of vodka<BR>1/2 measure Kina Lillet vermouth<P>Shake it very well until it's ice cold, pour into a deep champange glass. Garnish with a large thin slice of lemon peel. <P>Can you guess what type of drink this is???<P>You know... I also love drinking JD straight, ummmm.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Sounds like a Martini to me. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Anyone had any experience with Jamaican Rum? Earl Wray White Rum, awesome stuff, or their overproof rum. Great Stuff.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>||||reg||1
Z||000024||bHooper||02-23-2001||11:40 AM||||oh, i almost forgot... when going to college football games, i still prefer Segrams & mini bottles  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> and sprite!<P>JD just don't taste right with soda!<P>also, I had a uncle that used to make some seriously good white liquer... almost like liquified rock candy!  mmmm mmmm good||||reg||1
